<title>UK: Wuerttemberger Hypo sets Rex-linked Pfandbrief.</title>
<headline>Wuerttemberger Hypo sets Rex-linked Pfandbrief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following Rex-linked Pfandbrief was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WUERTTEMBERGER HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN MARK  COUPON    *5.50 PCT  MATURITY    23.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE   REX-LINKED    ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    23.JUL.97</p>
<p>FULL FEES  20 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    *LINKED TO THE REX 10-YEAR YIELD SUB-INDEX TIMES 80</p>
<p>PCT ON</p>
<p>	    AN 30/360 DAY BASIS</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    STUTT     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
